  263 chan_prefix: KW_CHAN
  264            | KW_CHAN "<-"

  265 function_declaration: KW_FUNC IDENTIFIER function_signature function_body
  266                     | KW_FUNC IDENTIFIER function_signature
  267                     | KW_FUNC IDENTIFIER type_parameters function_signature function_body
  268                     | KW_FUNC IDENTIFIER type_parameters function_signature

  269 function_signature: parameters
